  "title": "Mom&#39;s Mustard-Style Potato Salad",
  "description": "As potato salad recipes go, with potatoes, eggs, and celery, this one is traditional. But, prepared mustard in the creamy dressing gives it a bit of zing.",
  "authors": [
    "DAC92"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-10-28T15:02:42-04:00",
